              }
            ],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>First, notice that the line segment from <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 0]</span> to <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 1]</span> is split into <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\color{blue}3]</span> equal parts. </p>",
            "readable_text": "First, notice that the line segment from [MATH: 0] to [MATH: 1] is split into [MATH: \\color{blue}3] equal parts.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "graphic",
            "normalized_html": "<p><img src=\"/graphics/b5df9d555e3e5d2465966022cfc4426a\"></p>",
            "readable_text": "[IMG: /graphics/b5df9d555e3e5d2465966022cfc4426a]",
            "images": [
              {
                "src": "/graphics/b5df9d555e3e5d2465966022cfc4426a",
                "alt": ""
              }
            ],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We can land on our point by making <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\color{red}1]</span> whole step plus <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\color{blue}2]</span> part steps (out of a possible <span class=\"math\">[MATH: {\\color{blue}{3}}).]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We can land on our point by making [MATH: \\color{red}1] whole step plus [MATH: \\color{blue}2] part steps (out of a possible [MATH: {\\color{blue}{3}}).]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "graphic",
            "normalized_html": "<p><img src=\"/graphics/8e350f825fa881f5181f90439808a8dd\"></p>",
            "readable_text": "[IMG: /graphics/8e350f825fa881f5181f90439808a8dd]",
            "images": [
              {
                "src": "/graphics/8e350f825fa881f5181f90439808a8dd",
